                </semantic:outputEntry>
                <semantic:annotationEntry>
                    <semantic:text>Sea, Rail, and Air are the most suitable for long distances. Road is often excluded due to inefficiency over such long distances, and Intermodal becomes a practical choice for combining different modes.</semantic:text>
                </semantic:annotationEntry>
            </semantic:rule>
