                    <semantic:text>"Road"</semantic:text>
                </semantic:outputEntry>
                <semantic:annotationEntry>
                    <semantic:text>Sea, Rail, and Intermodal are ideal for bulky goods due to their capacity for large volumes. Road and Air are often impractical due to size and weight limitations.</semantic:text>
